      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait rly?? i was thinking it's probably just gas or something because i had a huge burrito for lunch and it's been kind of a lot. are u sure it's not just something i can treat at home with some antacids or something? i really don't want to go to the er if i don't have to, it's so expensive",
